        <mxCell id="Ix1DJ9jEfy01dlpOwwJF-3" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;App component&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- [?] How could FE acknowledge DFS is still running? Heartbeat&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- [?] How could FE stop DFS? Send packet `&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;GracefulShutdown` to DFS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- [?] How could FE communicate with DFS? Via UDS (i.e. LocalSocket in Android)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- [?] How could FE start DFS? Trigger [&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;NativeModule&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- [?] How could FE pass configurations to DFS? In trigger() method, FE passes configurations as arguments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- [DFS] runs as Android service&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- [&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;NativeModule&lt;/span&gt;] runs via expo-module&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- [&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;NativeModule&lt;/span&gt;] communicates with [DFS] via 2 methods: LocalSocket and TCP socket&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=15;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="1110" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iC8FfnfifFY1NS20QaIK-9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;startArrow=classic;startFill=1;curved=0;endArrow=none;endFill=0;" parent="1" source="iC8FfnfifFY1NS20QaIK-1" target="Ix1DJ9jEfy01dlpOwwJF-2" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="479" y="515" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="659" y="515" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
