        <mxCell id="XlupUd9Ih-bxfIsf6Ot6-5" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Feat: Exchange log message between DFS and Front-end&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;When DFS has any log messages, those are formatted as Log instances. Log instances are converted into bytes to transmit to DfsModule via UDS protocol for fast message exchanging.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At DfsModule, a UDS server (use Coroutine) is hosted to receive incoming byte-encoded Log message. DfsModule decodes and transmits to Front-end.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="XlupUd9Ih-bxfIsf6Ot6-1">
